    "definition_type_raw": "Descriptor",
    "source_book_raw": "Ultimate Magic",
    "definition_raw": "A language-dependent spell uses intelligible language as a medium for communication. If the target cannot understand or hear what the caster of a language-dependent spell says, the spell has no effect, even if the target fails its saving throw.",
